					"nextDialogs": [
						205120303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205120303,
					"content": "这…看起来确实…很浓郁啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120304,
					"content": "这东西真的能入药吗，做好了药，我得自己先试试。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120305,
					"content": "假如我出了什么事，安娜就拜托你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120306,
					"content": "…交给葛瑞丝修女照顾了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120307,
					"content": "然后告诉她，我去很远的地方工作了，拜托你了，这是我最后的愿望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120308,
					"content": "没事的，你别自己吓自己…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205120309,
					"content": "因为这药看着就很吓人啊！总之，这些你先收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205120310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205120310,
					"content": "一定要记得我说的话啊！",
